{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50306","headline":"夜度赤岭怀诸知己 · 佚名","name":"夜度赤岭怀诸知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山行夜诚实寐，拂晓遂登高。\n回首望知己，思君心郁陶。\n不闻龙虎啸，但见豺狼号。\n寒气凝如练，秋风劲似刀。\n深溪多渌水，断岸饶黄蒿。\n驿使□靡歇，人疲马亦劳。\n独嗟时不利，诗笔虽（原作「唯」）然操。\n更忆绸缪者，何当慰我曹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}